# Environment contract for {NAME}: every variable the app reads, typed. Copy to .env (gitignored).
# kind: knob = a plain setting, left commented until you need it; secret = an op:// pointer (op://<vault>/<item>/<field>), never the value; flag = a bool, off by default (0), that turns a change's new behaviour on.
# mise loads .env into every task; `mise run doctor` checks each value against its row.
